      "created_at": "2021-03-17T13:58:52Z",
      "updated_at": "2021-03-17T13:58:52Z",
      "body": "Looking around a map, you could also add Canada, Brazil, Argentina, Australia, France, India, Germany, Poland, Japan, and/or Nigeria if you want. Those places all seem to have some form of states/provinces. ",
