      "created_at": "2021-03-17T16:01:05Z",
      "updated_at": "2021-03-17T16:01:05Z",
      "body": "It's not so much about \"having provinces\", but rather \"do many people want to know the province for this, and what are the trade-offs with privacy?\"\r\n\r\nFor the US, China, and Russia this seems like a fairly decent trade-off as they're such huge countries. For Germany or France? I'm not so sure.",
