      "created_at": "2021-03-17T23:32:55Z",
      "updated_at": "2021-03-17T23:32:55Z",
      "body": "Yeah, maybe; but they're also far smaller (in terms of surface area) and have quite a different government structure especially from the US (with states having quite a lot of legal power).\r\n\r\nAnyway, remember this is just a *default* for new accounts; people can customize this as they see fit, including just tracking regions for all countries. Overall I'd prefer to be a little bit on the conservative side with this.",
